2024 Q3 revenue was $8,461,842 across 5,579 orders, up 4.8% on the prior quarter, with gross margin at 33.1% and 102,433 units shipped. The most significant movement was the Midwest, which was the weakest region at $1,061,883 and was hit by the loss of Halloway Group, the document says this was the single largest driver of the movement and that the commercial team attributes it to a competitor’s national framework agreement rather than service failure. A reader should also know that Southwest remained the strongest

v1 is three lines and produces something usable. v2 names the audience, states
